    <statement><p>Find the derivative of <m>\frac{7}{x^{5}}-\ln(2x+1)\text{.}</m></p>
<p><m>f'(x)=</m> <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
